{"title":"Tome Toolsmithing Gold","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Butcher, Ogre Charger, Ogre Mauler, Ogre Youth, Gaunt Ogre +2 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-youth\" title=\"Ogre Youth - dropped it in 4 of 219 looted corpses (1/55)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/55<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 30 of 1,766 looted corpses (1/59)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/59<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 9 of 1,033 looted corpses (1/115)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/115<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 17 of 2,879 looted corpses (1/169)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/169<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 4 of 86